      "Congratulate Colleagues 10 and 6 on the boundary analysis of Configuration 2A. Concede that multi-pair configurations with adjacent BB blocks trigger Round 2 eliminations.",
      "Shift the battleground to the epistemic disparity between |W_unseen| = 1 (White hats) and |W_unseen| = 2 (Black hats).",
      "Demonstrate why the Black-hat wearers (Seats 3, 5, 7) face a local degeneracy: even within the single-pair necklace, a Black hat seeing 4B/2W has two unobserved White hats. The hypothesis that one of those White hats is on their own head leaves open multiple consistent seat-offset hypotheses unless they already know the global round-elimination schedule of every other agent.",
